/tools/signing/local-test

# Build output
/dist

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Defence in depth.
#
# The path-based rules above already cover the real secrets. These patterns are
# a second net so that a key can never be committed just because it was moved,
# regenerated under a new name, or produced by a tool that writes elsewhere.
#
# Rationale: campusarena.p12 is the AppGallery release signing key. If it leaks,
# anyone can publish as the developer; if it is lost, the published app can
# never be updated again. It must never enter git history, because history is
# effectively permanent even after a file is deleted.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.p12
*.p7b
*.csr
**/material/
*private*.json
.agc-cache.json
credentials.json
.build-profile.json5.bak*
previewer.log
